      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Levothyroxine every morning on an empty stomach. The blue inhaler, salbutamol, when I need it. Folic acid once a day. And cyclizine from my GP for the sickness, 50 milligrams three times a day. I take it regularly.",
